\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S5}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Aggregate metrics by $\beta $ quartile, across composition methods.} Quartile cutoffs are computed from the calibrated $\beta $ distribution across the $423$-ticker universe. The hybrid KS pass rate declines from $87.6\%$ in Q1 to $65.9\%$ in Q4 as the market loading ratio $\rho _i$ grows; the naive KS pass rate falls from $24.6\%$ to $1.3\%$ over the same range.}}{14}{}\protected@file@percent }
